  data: {
    LLM: "Starting with best hand, players may 'Bieten' (bet) on any category they wish to contest. Any opposing player can either: Concede (auto-lose the category, worth its base value) OR Call (match the bet, escalating the point value). At showdown, the best hand wins the doubled/escalated value.",
    Player: "Starting with best hand, players may 'Bieten' (bet) on any category they wish to contest. Any opposing player can either: Concede (auto-lose the category, worth its base value) OR Call (match the bet, escalating the point value). At showdown, the best hand wins the doubled/escalated value.",
